<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome to AnyLicence</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f4f4; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">

  <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#f4f4f4">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:20px 0;">

        <!-- Main Container -->
        <table width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="border-collapse:collapse;">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#3a3a3a; padding:15px 30px 5px;"><img style="width:140px; height:auto" src="https://dev.anylicence.com/_next/static/media/logo.44813824.svg" alt="Any Licence" />
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Body -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:25px 30px; color:#333333; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6;">

              <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">
                <strong>Hi {{instituteName}},</strong>
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">
                Thank you for registering as a driving course on AnyLicence.com.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 20px;">
                Your account has been successfully created. AnyLicence helps instructors connect with genuine learners and grow their driving practice efficiently.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 10px;">
                <strong>To get started:</strong>
              </p>

              <ol style="padding-left:18px; margin:0 0 20px;">
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  Log in to your course account:
                  <a href="https://dev.anylicence.com" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                    Login
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li style="margin-bottom:8px;">
                  After login, to complete your courses profile and verification details:
                  <a href="https://dev.anylicence.com" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                    Profile
                  </a>
                </li>
                <li>
                  Start receiving learner course enquiries:
                  <a href="https://dev.anylicence.com" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                    Dashboard
                  </a>
                </li>
              </ol>

              <p style="margin:0 0 15px;">
                If you have any questions or require assistance, please contact us at
                <a href="mailto:support@anylicence.com" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                  support@anylicence.com</a>.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 25px;">
                We wish you a safe and successful learning course experience.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0;">
                <strong>Sincerely,</strong><br />
                Team AnyLicence<br />
                <a href="https://dev.anylicence.com" style="color:#ff9800; text-decoration:none;">
                  www.anylicence.com
                </a>
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <tr>
            <td style="background-color:#ffb300; height:5px; font-size:0px"></td>
          </tr>

        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>